        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Malay</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">683 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Family</span><span class="info-stat-val">Austronesian (Malayo-Polynesian): one of the Malayic languages, descended from Proto-Malayic, spoken in western <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/borneo">Borneo</a> at least by 1000 BCE.</span></div>
